---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
const posts = [
{title:"PostgreSQL Index를 적용하면 정말 빨라질까?",category:"Database",description:"100만 건 데이터와 EXPLAIN ANALYZE로 Index 효과를 검증한다.",href:"/posts/postgresql-index"},
{title:"Redis Cache 적용 전후 성능 비교",category:"Redis",description:"Cache Aside를 적용하고 응답시간과 DB 부하를 비교한다.",href:"/posts/redis-cache"}
];
---
<Layout title="Backend Developer">
<section class="hero"><div class="container">
<p class="eyebrow">BACKEND DEVELOPER · STUDY · ENGINEERING</p>
<h1>문제를 분석하고<br/><span>성능으로 증명하는 개발자</span></h1>
<p class="lead">Java · Spring · PostgreSQL · Redis를 중심으로<br/>실무 문제를 직접 실험하고 기록합니다.</p>
<div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/posts">기술 블로그 보기</a><a class="button" href="https://github.com/YOUR_GITHUB_ID">GitHub</a></div>
</div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container">
<div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">RECENT POSTS</p><h2>최근 기록</h2></div><a href="/posts">전체 보기 →</a></div>
<div class="grid">{posts.map(post => <a class="card" href={post.href}><span class="tag">{post.category}</span><h3>{post.title}</h3><p>{post.description}</p><span class="read">Read more →</span></a>)}</div>
</div></section>
<section class="section muted"><div class="container">
<p class="eyebrow">LEARNING PIPELINE</p><h2>공부한 것을 결과물로 남깁니다.</h2>
<div class="pipeline"><span>공부</span><b>→</b><span>구현</span><b>→</b><span>실험</span><b>→</b><span>측정</span><b>→</b><span>GitHub</span><b>→</b><span>Blog</span><b>→</b><span>면접</span></div>
</div></section>
</Layout>